{"id":"30dc8bccf7876b3f","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-prop-pcf-bounds.md","title":"pcf Bounds","display":"prop-pcf-bounds — pcf Bounds","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-pcf-bounds","aliases":["58-prop-pcf-bounds"],"display":"prop-pcf-bounds — pcf Bounds","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-pcf-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-pcf-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-pcf-bounds — pcf Bounds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (progressive set of regular cardinals: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\min(A)\">\\(|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> (pcf operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}pcf-bounds} \\vdash A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\to\\Bigl(\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\land|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq2^{|A|}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}pcf-bounds} \\vdash A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\to\\Bigl(\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\land|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq2^{|A|}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For a progressive set of regular cardinals, the pcf theorem gives a largest possible cofinality and the standard cardinality bound.</li>\n<li>The former expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)\\)</span> for a singular cardinal and the claim <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)&lt;\\lambda^+\">\\(\\max\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)&lt;\\lambda^+\\)</span> were not standard and were generally false.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pcf}$ (pcf operator, see [[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"|A|<\\min(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}pcf-bounds} \\vdash A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|A|<\\min(A)\\to\\Bigl(\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\land|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq2^{|A|}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\max\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)<\\lambda^+","display":false}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3986","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-prop-pcf-bounds.md|58-prop-pcf-bounds]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["b82cea6742372d50","0fbfc19800246e77"]}